\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Queen Marina's summoned all her subjects to the square. It seems to be important\emdash I'd suggest you too head there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
