\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The people of Cobblestone are truly amazing. We battered their village with our cannons, and then when we needed their help, they welcomed us with open arms.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now with the monsters gone, I want to do all I can to help the village get back on its feet. It's the least I can do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm a sword for hire, but that doesn't mean I don't have a heart. The people here have been good to me\emdash and I'm going to repay their kindness in any way I can.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You watch\emdash I'm not going to rest till Cobblestone is restored to its former glory!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now we're rid of those rotten monsters, I just can't stop singing! Oh, what a lovely day to be aliiive! \f1\u9834?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I didn't join Sir Hendrik's regiment just so I could ogle him. I'm not that type of girl, and I'll fight anyone who says I am.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But still, it'll be sad to see him leave. I don't suppose I'll be fighting alongside him again any time soon...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sir Hendrik! [pc]! One moment, please!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
