\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hmph. I never did get to use that giant crossbow, you know. Oh well, I can't complain. We're at peace, after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I owe it all to that holy water I bought from Mistress Bev! If it wasn't for that, I wouldn't have lived to see the sun again! I'm going to buy another thirty bottles once I've saved up enough money!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Did you buy any of Mistress Bev's holy water? If you're planning on travelling, I'd definitely stock up while you can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If anyone can rid us of the Lord of Shadows and all his hideous minions, it is you and Sir Hendrik! You can restore peace to the world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ahh, splashing around in the water with the sun beating down! How delightful! I haven't done this since I was a little girl!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But I must make sure that Sir Hendrik does not find out\emdash this is hardly behaviour befitting a soldier of Heliodor...but it's just such fun!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Come again? Sir Hendrik is here!? Oh my! I cannot have him seeing me splashing round in the water like a little girl! What would he say!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Can you do something for me? Can you tell Sir Hendrik that we will wait for him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Tell him that we will await his return, and that once peace is restored to the world, we will be honoured to serve under him once more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Can you believe it!? The King wishes to speak with Sir Hendrik yet again! What does he want this time?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Just once, I would like the King to make a request, and for Sir Hendrik to refuse it. Hm, can you imagine...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I've decided! Once Heliodor is back on its feet, I'm going to become a watchmaker! You just watch me! Ha ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: After all, I've been keeping track of the time ever since the sky went black. I reckon I've got a talent for it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Mayor has been deep in discussion with the King, and they've come up with a plan for all of us here at the Last Bastion.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We're going to stay posted here on the condition that we help rebuild Cobblestone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But that's not all. No, once that's done, the good people of Cobblestone are going to help us rebuild Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone's lost so much, but it seems we've found something too\emdash friendship and a shared purpose. We're putting the past behind us and building a future together!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hee hee! Wait until you get better, then you can ask me out on a date! Maybe, just maybe, I'll say yes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You and Sir Hendrik are my heroes! Make sure you come back and visit when this is all over, won't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But for now, you've got things to do\emdash like saving the world! We'll all be praying for your success!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'd do anything for you! I'm going to get back on my feet, then I'm going to ask you out! Just you wait and see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's not easy, you know! You really work up an appetite lying about all day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I reckon I'm entitled to take a little breather and gaze up at the sky. It's not like there are any monsters to watch out for any more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Just remember that you were Amber's boy long before you ever knew you were the Luminary.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So once you've done what you have to do, be sure to come back home! Your mother will be waiting!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A soldier just came round looking for you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Apparently, the King has something he wants you to do\emdash something he can't entrust to anyone else. You'd better head over and see what it's all about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I 'ope Sir 'Endrik an' [pc] like the flags we made. They're pretty amazin', even if I do say so meself. One's the 'Eliodorian flag, an' the other's the Luminary's mark.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Considerin' we just stitched 'em together from all the odds an' ends we 'ad lyin' around, they look well professional. If I wasn't a dancer, I'd sew full-time, I reckon. I've got a gift.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have learned a valuable lesson\emdash money really can't buy you everything. What use are all the riches in the world if you aren't alive to enjoy them?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's so long since I saw the sun, I'd almost forgotten how beautiful it is. It's enough to bring tears to your eyes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I think the King wants to speak to you. You should hurry up and head to his tent.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Heh heh! I knew you wouldn't let us down! I knew you wouldn't\emdash I don't know?\emdash abandon the Last Bastion and do a runner to the coast. I mean, who would do a thing like that? Heh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ahh, look at all the lovely twinkly stars! If only I had a pretty girl with me, it would be even better!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that the monsters are gone, I suppose we'll be able to go back home. But the thought of leaving everyone here makes me sad...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Poor Derk really does seems to be rather miserable of late. He barely sleeps a wink at night. Perhaps he is thinking of his old friend Erik.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: One is quite certain that he is out there somewhere alive and well, you know. But until he comes back and visits one's beloved husband, one rather expects he will remain miserable.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I guess once Cobblestone has been restored to its former glory, we'll be moving on. Seems a shame\emdash I've grown pretty attached to the place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Oh, it's you! If you want to head to the Tor, I won't stop you, but there's really not much to speak of up there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Oh, have you seen the King already, by the way? He wanted to speak with you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sir Hendrik, it has been a great honour to serve under you for all these years. I vow that until the day you return, I shall serve this realm faithfully and protect its people.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have grown so used to the idea of unending darkness that when the sun goes down, I become terrified that it will not rise again the next morning...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When this little fellow grows up, I hope he'll turn out to be every bit as strong and brave as you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Oh, and there was something I wanted to ask you. Umm... Would you do me the honour of allowing me to give him your name? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So he's going to be called [pc] Erdrick the Second! Pretty nice, right? It's got a good ring to it, don't you think?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Oh, that's a shame. Oh well, I'll just have to go with my second option\emdash Burpledink. It's not the most exciting name in the world, but I think it's good and solid. Little Burpledink. Yes. He'll like that, I'm sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The battle is over, but I remain concerned about Princess Jade. Where can she be?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I suppose there is little we can do but pray for her safety...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Princess Jade! It has been far too long. We always had faith that you would survive, of course, yet it is still a relief to see you alive and well.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You and Sir Hendrik really make an impressive pair. Someone should paint an epic portrait of the two of you, I reckon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's nice to see the smile back on 'Er Ladyship's face\emdash an' we owe it all to you! Nice work, sunshine!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
