\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I lost everything when Yggdrasil fell. My family, my friends, everything...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There was so much I wanted to do with my life, but how am I supposed to do any of it now?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I lost everything when Yggdrasil fell. My family, my friends, everything...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There was so much I wanted to do with my life, but how am I supposed to do any of it now?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar It seems like she's at a loss as to what to do next. Tell her about l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Derk\cell I was sayin' to me missus just this mornin' that I knew you was still out there somewhere! Yep, yer a survivor, alright! Cor, I'm so bleedin' 'appy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Derk\cell ...Oh, 'ark at me! I'm blabberin' away nineteen to the dozen, but you ain't got time for this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Derk\cell Listen, once yer done wiv all yer monster-slayin' an' world-savin', we'll 'ave a proper catch-up, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Derk\cell Till then, just remember that if yer ever in need o' supplies, Derk's yer man! In fact, let's get down to business, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Dunstan\cell Whatever trials and tribulations lie ahead, don't forget that this is your destiny, this is who you are. You're the Luminary, the Chosen One, and your purpose in life is to save the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Dunstan\cell However rough things get, I know you won't give up. If you keep moving forward, the road will open up before you. I have faith in you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Dunstan\cell So go and do it, [pc]! Go and batter the Lord of Shadows and then come home to Cobblestone. We'll be waiting for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell The town has been very badly damaged. It is too dangerous.\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\par
\b\fs24 2.03 - Angri-La\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Not so fast, traveller. The path to the summit is rife with monsters. None may pass this point without the High Lama's permission.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you wish to journey to the top of the holy mountain, you must return to Angri-La and speak with His Holiness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Summit of Mount Pang Lai \f2\u8594?\f0\lang9\par
\par
No entry without permission from the High Lama.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The path to the summit is rife with monsters. None may pass this point without the High Lama's express permission.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you wish to journey to the top of the holy mountain, you must return to Angri-La and speak with His Holiness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Some days ago, a hermit forced his way past us and ran toward the top of the mountain. Whether there was any purpose in his foolhardiness, I know not.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Several of my fellow disciples were despatched to find him and bring him back, but they too have yet to return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For your own safety, I cannot allow you to go any further. It would not do for you to go missing also.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote\emdash  Message from the High Lama \emdash\par
\par
Disciples of Angri-La. No doubt the events of recent days have come as a shock, but I urge you, do not lose hope.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Let us honour the memory of our fallen master by devoting ourselves wholly to our training. The Wheel of Time is always turning, but with good karma, we may speed their souls' progress back to the light.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have done you a great discourtesy, Luminary. I should have welcomed you with open arms, not bared fists. I pray that you can forgive me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His Holiness awaits you in the High Hall at the top of the temple. Please, proceed inside.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A thousand apologies. When I saw a knight of Heliodor, the kingdom that has suppressed our people for so long, I could not contain my anger.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I had no idea that you were the Luminary, and that you and he were comrades. I am deeply ashamed to have shown you such disrespect...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His Holiness knew that you were the Luminary at first glance. Would that my consciousness were as attuned as his...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Long have I trained to see that which cannot be seen, but it seems my third eye remains closed. I must continue my training.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to Angri-La. You are the Luminary, are you not? The one we have awaited all these years. His Holiness told us that you had come.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: How long we have looked forward to this day. Pray, stay and talk awhile before you proceed to the High Hall. Everyone is eager to meet you at last.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His Holiness has the power to sense a person's true nature with a single glance. This is why the Grand Master chose him to be the new High Lama in spite of his years.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Some of our less enlightened disciples resented being ruled over by a boy at first, but he has proved himself to be a wise and able leader, and gained the admiration of all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: All of the monks have gathered in the High Hall to welcome the Luminary to Angri-La. The day we've all been waiting for has finally come!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well, nearly all of us\emdash I don't really know what a Luminary is. I'll ask my mother later...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone is very excited that the Luminary's here. Whoever he is, he must be very important. Personally, I'm more of a fan of the Red-Cheeked Seeker myself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He was the Grand Master's most devoted disciple, and everyone says he was really, really tough! When I grow up, I want to be just like him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. We have been awaiting your arrival for many years.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: One of us was especially eager to meet you, but alas... (sigh) Pray, speak with His Holiness. He will tell you more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Here in the temple of Angri-La, disciples undergo the most arduous training imaginable in order to draw out their latent spiritual powers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Before the mountain path was barricaded by the Heliodorian army, would-be heroes would come here from all over Erdrea in the hope of learning the secrets of our strength.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now here's a face I haven't seen before. Tell me, are you the Prince of Dundrasil?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If it hadn'ta been for a couple o' kindly disciples comin' to my rescue, I'da been torn into itty-bitty bits! \par
\par
*: These fellas sure are strong. And fast\emdash you shoulda seen 'em wail on them varmints, quick as all get-out! Guess all this trainin' really does pay off!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Luminary has finally arrived! Ahh, what an auspicious day this is! I must prepare a banquet to celebrate!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I just saw a load of disciples racing into the High Hall. His Holiness must have summoned them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I've never seen them so excited before. I wonder what's going on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. This is the High Hall of Angri-La. His Holiness awaits you within.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We found this man lying unconscious on the slopes of the mountain. He was gravely injured, but we were able to nurse him back to health.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: At first, we were wary of him\emdash for many moons now, the soldiers of Heliodor have laid siege to our temple\emdash but it seems we had nothing to fear. He is a man of honour.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? Your friend the knight was also suspected of being an enemy of Angri-La? Ha ha! The disciples who doubted you must be deeply ashamed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But now is not the time to be gloating over their foolishness. It is a time for unity. The Lord of Shadows is the enemy of all humanity, and we must defeat him\emdash together.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was guarding the mountain gate when we were attacked by monsters. If the disciples hadn't come to my aid, I would surely have lost my life.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We had blockaded their home at Sir Jasper's orders, but despite this, they saved my life and welcomed me into their home. I can still hardly believe it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sir Jasper told us that this temple was a hive of villainy, but that can't be true\emdash these people have been nothing but kind.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I had heard that they believed in all that \lquote love your enemy\rquote  stuff, but I didn't believe it until I saw it for myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Angri-La is home to a society of monks who spend all their time training to be extra strong and clever. Are you here to train too?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\rquote We two sworn companions, Erdwin and Morcant, do hereby pledge to lay low the Dark One, though it cost us our very lives. May this pact stand from now until eternity.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: (sob sniff) Ah, forgive me... It is a pleasure to meet with you at last, Luminary. I only wish that Grand Master Pang could have shared in our joy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Grand Master had awaited your coming more eagerly than any other. If only our beloved leader had not been taken from us...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is my honour to serve as Chief Instructor of this temple. If Dundrasil had not fallen, I would have trained you as a child, according to the instructions of Grand Master Pang.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No doubt you are eager to undertake the training that is your birthright, but first, pray, speak with His Holiness. He awaits you by the entrance to the Field of Discipline, which stands behind the temple.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When the Lord of Shadows sent the World Tree crashing to the ground, Grand Master Pang summoned a mighty magical mandala to keep this temple safe from harm.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But the exertion was too great\emdash the Master did not return... A life was given to save those of we disciples\emdash we must make sure we put them to good use.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For months, Heliodor has laid siege to this temple, accusing us of harbouring the Darkspawn. All this despite our ancient alliance with Dundrasil, the nation that was once their closest ally.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No doubt their forces would have stormed the gates long ago were it not for their fear of the Grand Master. Pang's powers were enough to hold an entire army at bay.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Beyond this tunnel lies the Field of Discipline. Many would-be warriors have entered this sacred arena to train their bodies and their minds. Now, Luminary, it is your turn...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My friend was chosen to be the new High Lama. Now he's the most important person in Angri-La after the Grand Master, and everyone has to do what he says.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Amazing, isn't it? He's only the same age as me, but we couldn't be more different!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. This is the Grand Master's chamber. It is where Grand Master Pang herself resided. Until that fateful day\'85\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is also where you would have awoken each morning, if you had come here when you were a child and trained with us as you were supposed to...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Prince of Dundrasil, to the Field of Discipline, where your ancestors trained to become mighty warriors and wise rulers. The High Lama awaits you within.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Prince of Dundrasil, to the Field of Discipline, where your ancestors strove to become mighty warriors and wise rulers. The High Lama awaits you in the centre of the training ground.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah, Luminary. I trust you slept well last night? His Holiness awaits you outside. It seems he is keen to wish you luck on the next stage of your journey.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He had said he intended to speak with you alone, but I hear raised voices coming from the other side of the door. What could be happening out there, I wonder?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Last night's party was such fun! After all the terrible things that have happened lately, it was wonderful to see everyone enjoying themselves for once!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hello! How did you enjoy the party last night? Our butter tea is the best in all Erdrea, don't you think?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Good morning, Luminary. Did you enjoy last night's banquet?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: With the Grand Master gone, there is little we of Angri-La can offer to you apart from our hospitality. Please, feel free to rest here as long as you like.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? What am I doing? Nothing more than you see\emdash running around the Field of Discipline. It is part of my training.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If I work hard enough and study long enough, perhaps one day the Master will deem me fit to face the most legendary of all our trials: the Wheel of Harma!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Urrrgh... I think I had too much fun at the party last night...but I must keep dancing. The High Lama would be furious if I were to neglect my training.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This dance may look simple, but it takes many years of training to perform it precisely and rhythmically.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Only when I can keep dancing the whole day through will I finally be ready to proceed to the next stage of my training...but my arms feel like they are going to fall off already!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the Field of Discipline, the most sacred place in Angri-La. Through the ages, many a would-be warrior has spilt blood, sweat and tears upon these flagstones.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Why, if it isn't the Luminary! His Holiness sent word that you would be coming. You are going to rescue the hermit who went off to the top of the mountain, correct? \par
\par
*: Please, be careful. It would not do for one as important as yourself to go missing too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thank you for agreeing to help search for the hermit. I wish that I could go with you, but as Chief Instructor of Angri-La, I must stay behind to guard the temple.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is with a heavy heart that we ask an honoured guest to take such a risk on our behalf, but since the fall of Yggdrasil, the monsters on the mountain have grown stronger than ever before. \par
\par
*: None but the Luminary could possibly prevail against them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You are heading to the top of the mountain, are you not? To get there, simply follow the path to the east when you leave the temple grounds.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: By all accounts, there are many dangerous monsters lurking up there. If you are injured in battle, pray, return here to rest and recover.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, is it true that you are going to the peak of Pang Lai to find the missing hermit?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I want to go with you, but I would only slow you down. I will wait here instead, and pray for your safe return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was not by chance that the very first Grand Master of Angri-La built this temple in such an isolated, precipitous place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Here, the disciples are far removed from all worldly temptations, and can dedicate themselves wholly to their training. Ai Yi was a wise man indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everything happens for a reason. That is what the Grand Master used to say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The reason that you came to this temple when you did must surely have been to save the hermit. Go, Luminary, and follow your fate!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone is very worried about the hermit who climbed the mountain on his own.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If the Red-Cheeked Seeker were here, he would surely run right up there, save the day and be back in time for dinner!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you, the Luminary reborn, had trained here as a child, goodness knows what powers would now be at your command. Perhaps you would be strong enough to defeat the Lord of Shadows...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But it is bad karma to wish for that which cannot be. Now that Grand Master Pang is gone, so too are the secrets of ultimate power. We must make our peace with this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Wasn't the food at the banquet delicious? I made it all: the steamed bread, the dumpling curry\emdash everything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: All the other disciples are suffering too, but they still stick to their training! You must follow their example! You can't just run away when things get difficult!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My old friend Rab was such a little rascal, always making mischief. His antics drove all the instructors to distraction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No matter how many times Grand Master Pang took the Naughty Stick to him, he never changed his ways. It was almost as if he was doing it on purpose...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Rab might have been a little troublemaker, but once he set his mind on something, he would always see it through to the end. To tell the truth, I had a bit of a soft spot for him...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was moseyin' around down the mountain when I found myself smack dab in the middle of a gang o' monsters fixin' to eat me up. If these fellas hadn'ta come to my aid, I'd be pushin' up daisies!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They sure are the kindest folks a girl could ever hope to meet. Reckon I'll stick around awhile, make myself at home\emdash it's a mighty dangerous world out there for a lady on her lonesome.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This cutie-pie here can't even look me in the face when he talks to me. I do declare he's the sweetest little monk I ever did see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Tee hee! I like my fellas shy and retirin'\emdash they're so much fun to tease! I'm fixin' to whisper a sweet nothin' or two in his ear just to watch him squirm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The bond between Dundrasil and Angri-La was first established in the Age of Heroes when Erdwin, a native of your kingdom, came here on his quest to slay the Dark One.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Perhaps it was your honourable predecessor who led you here to us, that history could come full circle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Why would that hermit head to the top of the mountain alone? Does he not know the place is infested with monsters that have been driven into a frenzy by the Lord of Shadows?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Grand Master was a teacher beyond compare. It was not only the princes of Dundrasil who grew to be mighty warriors under Master Pang's tutelage, but many others too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I came here to train under the Master myself, only to find that I was too late... Ahh, what crimes did I commit in my last life to deserve such terrible luck...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to the High Hall of Angri-La. It was built in the Age of Heroes, and is considered to be one of the wonders of ancient Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was originally constructed by the first Grand Master, Ai Yi, and has been extended and renovated many times since. The great tower you see today is the work of generations.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The path to the top of the mountain lies to the east as you exit the temple. Be very wary\emdash there are many fearsome creatures lying in wait there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The disciples did all they could to rescue the hermit, but it seems it was an impossible task\emdash for them, at least.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is only by the grace of the heavens that they were not more badly injured. I will attend to their wounds. As for the hermit\emdash his fate is in your hands.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This soldier tells me he once believed that the Luminary was no hero, but a malevolent being known as the Darkspawn. It seems everyone in Heliodor believed the same.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But do not worry\emdash I have made him see the light. His mind is now cleared of that misconception, and he does not believe you to be evil any more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When I heard that the monks held a banquet in the so-called Luminary's honour, I couldn't believe it. Sir Jasper was right\emdash they were in league with the Darkspawn all along.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But how can that be? Why would such kind, noble people ally with a being of purest evil? I don't know what to believe any more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Urrrgh... Even after years of training, I was unable to rescue a lone hermit... I have brought shame upon my masters...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, I beg you\emdash do not fail him as I have done! Go forth, and bring the hermit back to safety!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hello, Luminary. You're going to rescue that man who went up the mountain, aren't you? I wish my brother was as brave as you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah, brother... Don't give up... You can do it... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Erdwin and Morcant are remembered as the closest of friends, but they did not get along at first.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They began as bitter rivals\emdash one day, they had a duel in the Field of Discipline to decide, once and for all, who was the strongest.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For three days and three nights they battled against one another, but neither was able to get the upper hand. When they could fight no longer, the duel was declared a draw.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was then that they recognised each other's true strength\emdash and from that moment, they were inseparable. Ho ho! They certainly were a pair of hot-blooded boys!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When one possesses great strength, it is easy to become isolated from one's fellow man.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No doubt both Erdwin and Morcant were overjoyed to find a friend whose powers rivalled their own.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
