\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I feared for the future of our world when Yggdrasil fell, but now, I see a glimmer of hope in the darkness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You and Lord Robert have come back to us, and with the secret powers of the Grand Master at your command, no less. Surely these will be enough to lay Mordegon low.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Arboria and Angri-La sit on the same mountain range that surrounds the First Forest. The ridge between our villages was once a busy trade route.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thanks to the Grand Master's mandala, Angri-La survived the blast that reduced much of the world to rubble. I fear Arboria may not have been so fortunate...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My son thought of abandoning his training, but after seeing how you risked your life to save your grandfather and learn the ancient secrets of our temple, he has had a change of heart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He may never become as strong as you, Luminary, but so long as he keeps dedicating himself to his training, I am sure that he will make a fine disciple.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was such a relief to finally see the face of my old friend Rab again. He had been missing for so long, I had started to fear the worst.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was moseyin' around down the mountain when I found myself smack dab in the middle of a gang o' monsters fixin' to eat me up. If these fellas hadn'ta come to my aid, I'd be pushin' up daisies!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They sure are the kindliest folks a girl could ever hope to meet. Reckon I'm gonna stick around\emdash whatever happens, I can rely on them to take care o' li'l ol' me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Whenever I drag my boots up to this here place, the monks all start crowdin' 'round. Guess they ain't none too used to havin' a lady like li'l ol' me round these parts.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But they're awful sweet, and mighty kind too. I can't help but smile every time I clap eyes on the li'l darlin's!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I could hardly believe my eyes! Lord Robert was thin as a rake when he sat down to breakfast, but as he gulped his butter tea and golloped his tsampa, he put the pounds back on right there as I watched!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Truly, his powers are far beyond those of a normal man. It is no wonder he was the Grand Master's favourite.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? You were still asleep when Lord Robert returned to his original size and shape?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: How unfortunate! Truly, it was a miracle to behold. What a shame you were not there to witness it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The void... I have read of this chasm between life and rebirth\emdash some call it \lquote purgatory\rquote , others \lquote bardo\rquote ... So it would seem the legends are true...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If I should leave this mortal realm, would I too awaken in that world of nothingness? I shudder to think of it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Please, let me become a disciple and train with you! I want to become a mighty warrior and fight back against the monsters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that you trained with Grand Master Pang. I can't begin to tell you how envious I am. She was the most famous fighting tutor in all Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah, Luminary. The High Lama awaits you in the Field of Discipline. His Holiness has prepared a special training regimen for you\emdash the legendary Wheel of Harma.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is a formidable trial indeed, but there is no better way to cultivate one's spiritual and physical strength.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This warrior wishes to become a disciple of Angri-La. Normally, we would not allow outsiders to join us, but given the grave state of the world, we cannot turn him away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Desperate times call for desperate measures. So long as he is willing and able to train, Angri-La will welcome him with open arms.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The lands that lie farthest from Yggdrasil escaped the worst of the damage from the Fall, but it seems they have not been spared the monsters' aggression.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Curse you, Mordegon! Have our people not suffered enough?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This soldier used to believe that the Luminary was in fact an evil being called the Darkspawn, but I have finally managed to unburden him of this misconception.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Until now, I was convinced that you were the Darkspawn, a being of purest evil who would bring ruin to our realm...but now I see that I was wrong.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You were fighting to save this world with all your might. And you continue to do so even now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Though I know that the wrongs we of Heliodor have done you cannot be excused, please allow me to offer you my sincerest apologies. Forgive me, Luminary...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We slandered your name and hunted you like a wild beast, yet still you fought to save us. Few others would have been so magnanimous.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You are a man of great honour, Luminary. I pray that you prevail in the battle against the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hooray, you saved the hermit! You must be a million times stronger than my brother! Can you teach him how to be tough like you?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah, brother... Don't give up... You can do it... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that Rab has been building up quite the collection of, erm...how can I put this...provocative periodicals. It seems there's life in the old dog yet!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ahh, that takes me back... I remember when the Grand Master found us thumbing through the very first copy of the Ogler's Digest Rab ever sneaked in... She was so angry neither of us could sit down for a week...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: (sob sniff) ...Forgive me. Whenever I remember that Grand Master Pang will never shout at us again, I become unable to hold back the tears.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No doubt you know this already, having spoken to the Grand Master in person, but she was a woman of infinite kindness, and cared deeply for every one of her disciples.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yes, the more harshly she treated us, the more keenly we felt her affection...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Grand Master Pang had awaited your coming for many years. You may only have met for a short time, but I am certain it would have meant the world to her to see you at last.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Will you be joining us in our training today, [pc]?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: According to the legends, the friendship between Angri-La and Dundrasil began in the Age of Heroes, when the Dark One threatened to bring all Erdrea to ruin.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: After the Dark One's defeat, the King of Dundrasil made a pact with Grand Master Ai Yi to train the princes of his kingdom in the ancient arts of Angri-La. \par
\par
*: That way, they would always be ready to defend their people should crisis ever strike again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For twenty long years have I endured the harshest trials, that I might one day gain mastery of the hidden powers of Angri-La.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My dream is to master Erdwin's signature skill: the spiritual sword that tears through time and space\emdash Quadraslash! Would you not like to learn such an ability yourself?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah, Luminary. Forgive me for making you bear witness to such an embarrassing scene. I was just speaking with my mother.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I know that I have no talent for dance, but that simply means that I must train all the harder. One day, I will become a fully fledged disciple\emdash I swear it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That fluffy, round tail... Those pretty ears that bob and bounce... That velveteen dress that clings to every curve...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Could this really be the very same bunny girl I have seen in my sleep every night since first I glimpsed her face in the Ogler's Digest? To be able to meet her in real life is truly a dream come true!\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\par
\b\fs24 2.04 - Puerto Valor\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When Yggdrasil came crashin' down, there was a big landslide round these parts, and the path to Puerto Valor got blocked off. And that ain't all that's changed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I 'eard you can get through the valley over on the west side o' the Champs Sauvage now. It's like this ain't the world I remember no more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Anyway, long story short, if you're goin' to Puerto Valor, you'll 'ave to 'ead along the coast to the east there, then up west over the 'ills. Got it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I came here via the collapsed valley up ahead, but things are pretty messed up over to the west there\emdash must be because it's so close to where the World Tree fell.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And I've been hearing about a crowd of young men roaming the land in outlandish costumes, making all sorts of unholy commotion as well. Be careful, whatever you do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: \'a1Buenos d\'edas, se\'f1or! Not many people make the journey to visit us here in Puerto Valor any more. It is simply too dangerous.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But you must not be afraid! We knights shall protect the town and its people! We will continue to fight, until no monster is left standing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I've heard that the impact of Yggdrasil falling opened up a valley to the north-west and made it passable again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But just because you can go somewhere, it doesn't mean you should, s\'ed? We've been hearing about a horde of mysterious young chicos roaming the area. They're with the Lord of Shadows, for sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was just here on holiday, but what with everything that's happened, it's the least I can do to try and help defend the place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I mean, I've heard Heliodor's been destroyed anyway, so I won't have anything to go back to. I might as well try and make myself useful here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hmm... I don't think I've seen your face before. I suppose you're another refugee, are you? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He was badly injured rescuing a local boy from the clutches of a monster. He's been bedridden for days...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yes, I thought as much. I'm from Heliodor myself. I only just made it out in time... Still, at least this place seems safe\emdash for now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm not sure where all the other Heliodorians have got to, though. I suppose they must be scattered all over the place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This man is spreading rumours about a horde of demons parading around the other side of the valley to the north-west.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay... Everybody is already scared of the Lord of Shadows. There's no need to make people even more worried.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I, I saw them! I promise! Over to the west of here, a whole gang of horrible, gaudy demons, all parading in a line!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They were playing music and dancing... I think they're probably people who sold their souls to the Lord of Shadows or something.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's all over, innit? The world's gonna end... We're all gonna die... The Lord o' Shadows is gonna get 'is grubby mitts on all of Erdrea...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We came here to Puerto Valor on our holidays, and now we cannot go back home. Still, I am sure there are worse places to spend the rest of your days.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am just glad that my wife and I got to see the southern ocean before it was too late. Before the end of the world came...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I will never forget the day that Yggdrasil fell. We were sitting here, staring out to sea... Ohhh... It's painful to think about it, even now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: What is to become of us, without the great tree's protection? What are we to believe in, now it has gone?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I got attacked by monsters out west of here, but I was rescued! Rescued by a parade of mysterious\emdash and rather fabulous\emdash young men!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If anyone has any hope of saving this world, it's them. But no one in this town believes me! They're trying to say that I dreamt up the whole thing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: Ese d\'eda... That day... It was the day the music died. And without music, I cannot dance. Everything is broken now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The sea here in Puerto Valor was always so blue... So beautiful... But since the Fall, it is dull and dirty. I have not seen a single fish since that day, se\'f1or.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? You are here for the casino? S\'ed, we are still in business. It will take more than the fall of Yggdrasil to stop people gambling!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay, but we are not open yet. Perhaps you would like to join the queue and wait with the other customers? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sorry, se\'f1or! The casino is not open yet!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The casino is always there for you se\'f1or, even in the darkest times. And since the fall of Yggdrasil, our prizes are more impressive than ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So do not delay! Proceed downstairs and make your dreams come true! \'a1Vamos, vamos!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay ay ay, you look so tired, se\'f1or. Your journey here must have been a long and difficult one...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: S\'ed, it is true. More monsters mean that I sell more weapons...but I cannot be happy about this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have my little hija\emdash my daughter\emdash to think about. She cannot stop crying. Our son is a soldier, and we have not seen him since that day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We may never see him again, but I cannot tell my daughter this. I do not want to believe it myself...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now it is more important than ever to have good, strong armour. Make sure you are protected, before it is too late...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You have seen the mountain to the north, se\'f1or? Its name is Pang Lai. My son has been deployed there as a guard.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yggdrasil came down just on the other side of it. The impact must have been much worse over there. I hope my little ni\'f1ito is safe...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: (sob) Waaah... My hermano\emdash my brother... (sniff) I saw him! He was dressed up in strange clothes... (sob)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: My grandson\emdash this ni\'f1ita's older brother\emdash works as a guard at Mount Pang Lai. We are so proud of him...but we have not seen him since the Fall...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We had accepted that he would never return... But then my granddaughter started saying that she had seen him outside of town...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that Yggdrasil has fallen, there is no place for our late priest's soul to go. It must still be floating around somewhere in the world... (sigh) But life goes on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My friend the nun puts on a brave face, but the death of the priest hit her hard. Of course, everyone in town is also in low spirits. Qu\'e9 desesperaci\'f3n...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Even Don Rodrigo has been injured, and is unable to leave his bed. I wish there was some way to restore the people's hope...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well hello there, young man! Now, I know that times are hard, but that's no excuse to be neglecting your wardrobe!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I mean, you mustn't forget there's armour and accessories out there that can give people a totally new look\emdash even more so if they rock them as a set!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm a big believer that a sharp outfit is the key to a sharp mind\emdash and heaven knows we could all use a bit of mental clarity. So don't forget to make sure you look fabulous!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Goo day, sir! Right now, our hotel is accommodating many, many injured guests. Fortunately, you're talking to someone ooze able to sort out just such little conundrums! We still have a room for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We are offering free beds and rooms to people who have been injured or have fallen ill, but we do not have enough people to nurse them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am a maid, not a nurse, so I do not know how to give people the care they need. But they are in so much pain, I just have to do what I can...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hnghhh... Ayyy... It hurts so much... Curse those monsters... Ayyy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: La luz roja... The red...light...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: Poor hombre... His ship was attacked and dragged down into the ocean. It is a miracle that he survived\emdash truly un milagro. Sadly, all his crewmates are missing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And he has such terrible nightmares. He keeps talking about a red light. I can't imagine what he must have seen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yeah, a monster got me. But it wasn't an ordinary monster. It was...completely out of control... Hnghhh... It got me bad...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Still, I'm not going to complain. I know how lucky I am to be alive. I don't want to think about how many people have died...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...\lquote The pub\rquote ? Oh, you mean the taberna? S\'ed, it is closed. Closed forever. They killed the owner.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There is no dancing on the beach any more, either. Only mourning. But mourning will not bring back the dead, se\'f1or...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Mi hijo\emdash my boy\emdash he was attacked by monsters. Fortunately, Don Rodrigo saved him...but he suffered some terrible injuries in the process...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay, but my son blames himself, and refuses to come out of his room... I do not know what I can say to him, se\'f1or...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Our son has been terribly sad ever since Don Rodrigo got hurt saving him from the monsters... It is una tragedia. I do not know what to say to him...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay, it is such a shame that Don Rodrigo's son is not here. He always had a way of cheering up my boy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: Don Rodrigo was injured while protecting me! It is all my fault! \'a1Todo es mi culpa!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar He's fast asleep. There are tearstains all over his face.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the way to the villa of Don Rodrigo. Maybe you have not heard, but he is injured at the moment, and cannot receive guests.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He was attacked while protecting a local ni\'f1ito\emdash a little boy\emdash from monsters. Ahh, Don Rodrigo... S\'ed, he is not young, but he is still so, so brave...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We do not know when the monsters will attack us, s\'ed? We caballeros should be training harder than ever right now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I intend to become strong enough to protect everyone in Puerto Valor, and I intend to do it soon! I will not rest until I am ready!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
