\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell I advise you to return when he has awoken.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar There's a portrait hanging on the wall.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Don Rodrigo's injury was the final straw for many of us. Ever since he has been bedridden, Puerto Valor feels as though it is at the bottom of a deep, dark sea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sometimes I think the only thing that would give us hope would be if Don Rodrigo's son were to return. He would brighten Puerto Valor up once more, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Don Rodrigo's son was nothing like his father. He was so bright, so cheerful.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I do not think I have ever known such a ray of sunshine, se\'f1or. Ay, if only he were here now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
