\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell I expect you wish to meet with your old teacher, s\'ed? Unfortunately, he has been gravely injured, and is resting at the moment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
