\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell Could you return when he has awoken, por favor?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10344 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Are you interested in playing some real poker, se\'f1or? Then you should come play with the big boys\emdash and the big sister! Each hand costs 100 tokens.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
