\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And you really do look wise beyond your years, no? You will fit right in at my table.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
