\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So my work, it is very important, capisce? And you are disturbing it! Go now! Andare!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Buon giorno, signore! My master, he has returned from his travels, and I am an happy, happy person in this moment!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Is not because he return, of course\emdash is because he can pay me all the money he owe!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
