\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But I no have any idea what to cook! Maybe his friend, he like the salty food, s\'ec...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I give Placido's friend from the sea the same food we usually eat. I no know if he like it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, you're alive! ...And you say you laid Alizarin low? I can barely believe my ears! We haven't had such good news in years!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thank you, thank you! You're a hero through and through!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The waters around Nautica resound with life and laughter once more! That villain Alizarin was made of strong stuff\emdash we can't thank you enough for duffing him up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Pardon? Will I be going back down to the seabed town? For now, I thought I'd stick around on this isle for a while. It's become something of a home from home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: All hail the Luminary, the hero who laid Alizarin low! Thank you so much for kicking that stinking skink into touch!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I knew only you could cut through Alizarin's shining shield! Everything unfolded just like I foretold it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\par
*: I hear another murmur echoing beneath the waters\emdash the happy celebrations of the ocean's sons and daughters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thank you, thank you, oh so much for saving Mother Ocean! You don't know what this means to me\emdash I'm bursting with emotion!\cell\row 
