\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The World Tree's fallen, the sky's gone dark, our nets are empty and our hearts are filled with fear...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Our village couldn't be further from Yggdrasil, but everything's changed all the same. What's happened to our world?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You've come a long way to see us again, friend. Did you want to talk to my boy, Kainui? He's probably over on Saikiki Beach.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I don't know why, but ever since the night of the luau, he's been spending an awful lot of time there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He was never much of a talker in the first place, but lately he's been saying even less. Guess he must have something on his mind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When the World Tree fell, my honeybunch lost the will to carry on. She fell into a deep despair and... Well, in the end she passed away...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I come here to listen to the lapping of the waves. It reminds me of her happy laughter...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: (shudder) I've never seen anything like it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And whatever you do, steer clear of the inland sea. You'd need more lives than a popoki to escape that place alive...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They say the souls of the departed swim across the ocean from Saikiki Beach to return to Yggdrasil. But with the World Tree gone, where will they go now?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Will they just drift down into the cold, dark water, lost and alone...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was sailing back home after a day's fishing when a bright red light appeared in the water and a monster the size of a mountain burst from the waves...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10368 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
