\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Queen Marina\cell I feared the flame of hope was quenched by misery and pain, but thanks to you, it blazes in my subjects' hearts again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Queen Marina\cell Though Yggdrasil has sunk to earth, Her will lives on in you. Heed the counsel of your heart, and see your mission through.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
