\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I did not expect my beloved darlings ever to have to go to war. I should have treated them better when I had the opportunity...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hello there, young man! How about a visit to the circus? It's just the ticket when you need to shake off those end-of-the-world blues!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Entry's free during the daytime! Come along and get yourself cheered up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is my special VIP seat! No one has a better view of Erdwin's Lantern than me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar It's a horse with a beautifully brushed coat.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the entrance to the spectator stands. Seats would once sell out in a matter of minutes, but since the star started falling, sales have greatly decreased...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ever since the Lantern commenced its descent, we have had very few visitors from other kingdoms. There is very little for an innkeeper to do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Many people wish to spend all their money before the world is destroyed, but others prefer a different approach.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Perhaps it is better to hold something in reserve, in case things turn out to be not quite so bad as they seem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am sorry, sir. We are not open yet. Return in the evening, please.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Truly, I am busier than ever. The girl I employed to help me has fled the city, leaving me to cope with everything by myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I thought perhaps that I would have fewer customers, but in fact, I have many more than before. Dark times tend to drive people to drink, I suppose...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Our priest was killed by monsters. He was walking outside the city, and went to a child's aid. The beasts turned on him instead, and took his life...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am by no means capable, but nevertheless, I have decided to spend the rest of my days continuing his good work...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband is a desert knight. He and his unit have ventured beyond the city walls in search of a means of dealing with the Lantern.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am sure that he will have to face many monsters, and naturally I am concerned...but I must remain strong until his return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My boy was once absolutely obsessed with the circus, but now he speaks of nothing but Erdwin's Lantern.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband is a horseman\emdash trained only to ride around a racetrack\emdash but now he has been drafted into the army, and is expected to spend his days fighting monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His hunger when he returns home is frightening! Every day I struggle to prepare enough food!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband is a horseman\emdash trained only to ride around a racetrack\emdash but now he has been drafted into the army, and is expected to spend his days fighting monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My daughter so loves her father. I wish he were able to return to her with the joy with which he used to return from the races. But...I know times are hard...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My family have been loyal Gallopolitan subjects for generations. Indeed, this house was given to us by a former Sultan in recognition of the contribution we have made to the kingdom.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That is why I would never consider fleeing. Even against a falling star, I will fight to protect the house of my ancestors.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: 'Ooever lived in this 'ouse before got scared and decided to 'ightail it out o' Gallopolis. I thought I might as well move in, since they won't be needin' it no more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: 'Ere, don't look at me like that! I ain't done nuffink wrong! 'Oo cares about a bit of 'ousesittin' when the world's about to end!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'll tell ya wot, this is a proper nice gaff. Plenty o' space, lovely furniture... Yeah, I reckon I could live 'ere long-term...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The horses have been deeply troubled of late. ...Hm? How do I know? Oh, it is very simple. One can learn a lot from examining their manure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Recently, the colour has been very troubling indeed... It is a sure sign that the horses are just as frightened as everyone else in Gallopolis...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There, there... That big star is nothing to be frightened of...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The horses have not been the same since Erdwin's Lantern started falling. It is as though they can sense that all is not right with the world...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is most curious\emdash I know the danger that Erdwin's Lantern poses, and yet I cannot help but be charmed by it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is no doubt an indication of its great power...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hup! Hip-hip! Phew... A few of my performers ran away in the night, so I've had to take the stage instead! I wish I had a few more tricks up my sleeve...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Still, the show must go on! No one comes to the circus to hear me grumbling\emdash especially not at a time like this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...What's that? Aren't I a performer myself? Ha! Not a chance. I'm better suited to a...leadership role.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I can still work up a crowd if need be, though! Hip-hip...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Did you see that Lantern thing floating in the sky? Pretty creepy, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We're all trying our best to cheer everyone up, but I can see why a bit of clowning won't cut it when people have something like that hanging over them...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm pulling out all the stops to try and get people's attention, but no one's the least bit interested. All they want to look at is Erdwin's Lantern.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Let's face it, I don't have any tricks up my sleeve that can compete with that thing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Personally, I think we circus performers have a duty to try and cheer people up at times like these, but clearly not everyone agrees\emdash quite a few have run off already.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I can't judge them too harshly, though. I mean, it's not like I haven't seen Erdwin's Lantern for myself\emdash I know how scary it is.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The racetrack has struggled to do business ever since the Lantern commenced its descent. As such, I have decided to gamble more than ever to try and support its continued operations!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I would gladly spend every penny I had if it helped to keep the racetrack open. After all, there is simply nothing more joyous than a horse race well run!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the racetrack of Gallopolis. Though our kingdom faces unprecedented danger, the racing calendar is unaffected.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you wish to take part in a race yourself, please enquire at the reception desk within.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A giant star is about to descend upon us. Surely I should be preparing to flee the city...and yet here I am, at the racetrack yet again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The truth is, racing is a part of my life. It is too deeply ingrained within me. To abandon it is simply not an option!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote The Knight's Pledge\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote A knight's word is his bond, his kingdom his master.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote He serves the weak untiringly, challenges the strong unflinchingly and never retreats in the face of adversity.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Something else has been scrawled on the poster in an untidy hand...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Will your precious pledge stop the star from squashing us all? No! We must flee the city, all of us!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Persons possessing information pertaining to Erdwin's Lantern are requested to report to His Exalted Majesty the Sultan immediately.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to the Sultan's Palace! You look rather tired. Your journey here was a long and arduous one, I suspect?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Though not as arduous as the journeys of others, of course. I have heard reports of many who have been killed while attempting to cross the desert.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah! You are the adventurer who visited us here some time ago, are you not? Perhaps you have learned something of Erdwin's Lantern on your travels?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If so, you must share it with His Exalted Majesty the Sultan immediately, please. He is currently asking scholars from all over Erdrea to bring him information concerning the star.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You must not tell anyone else about this, but the truth is, I have made plans to leave Gallopolis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have a family to think about. My loyalty to them is greater than my loyalty to my kingdom\emdash especially as that kingdom is about to be destroyed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Do not falter, men! Do not whimper! A falling star is no match for the immovable resolve of a desert knight!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We will defend Gallopolis at all costs, just as the pledge dictates!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Erdwin's Lantern is simply another form of the adversity that we knights pledge to overcome.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We must do as the captain says. We must defend Gallopolis at all costs. Even if it... (shudder) Even if it costs us our lives... (gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: (pant gasp) This is...too much...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I understand the importance of knightly training, and I do not deny that it is necessary...but to claim that we can prevent a star from falling star is simply foolish!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You wish to speak to Prince Faris? A thousand pardons. He is not present at the moment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: These are the chambers of our exalted Sultan and beloved Sultana. It has been deemed necessary for me to stand guard here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For in these troubled times, it is quite possible that some desperate soul will enter the palace seeking shelter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
