\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I cannot help but feel foolish. After all, the star was named for the ancient hero. How could we possibly have feared it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
