\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You must have been so terribly worried... I have caused you so much trouble, my love... But fear not\emdash I am home for good now. We are a family once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My father went out to fight monsters, but now he has come home\emdash and his horsie too! This is a most happy day for me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I owe my life to my trusty steed. Were it not for his sharp wits, I would surely have perished out there in the desert.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was accustomed to witnessing his talents on the racetrack, but to see him come to my aid in battle...this was moving indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was gone a long time, off fighting monsters. It is such a joy to be at home once more! Finally, a place where my heart can be still!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that some form of saviour destroyed Erdwin's Lantern. But surely such an act is beyond any normal man. Is this saviour even human?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: People are saying that a saviour came to our aid, and destroyed Erdwin's Lantern before it could reduce Gallopolis to ruins.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But who could this person be? Surely no ordinary man could have accomplished such a feat. I hope I have the opportunity to meet him one day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: 'Ooever lived in this 'ouse before got scared and decided to 'ightail it out o' Gallopolis. I thought I might as well move in, since they wouldn't be needin' it no more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But as soon as that star went pop, they came 'ome an' kicked me out on me ear! And there I was finkin' I'd finally found a place to call 'ome...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone's well chirpy now that Erdwin's Lantern fingy ain't around no more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But they need to wind their necks in a bit, I reckon\emdash it ain't like the Lord o' Shadows is gone. We've still got plenty to worry about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: CRASH! BANG! Yaaay! I am the saviour! I am the one who smashed the Lantern! Hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am pretending to be the saviour! You know who he is, yes? He is the one who smashed the falling star and saved Gallopolis!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am never leaving Gallopolis again! My mother makes the best food in all of Erdrea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Falling stars are not scary at all! The saviour will always keep us safe!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We ran away from Gallopolis because of that star, but then it disappeared, and we were able to come home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now we can all live here together forever! I never need to say goodbye to anyone ever again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone in Gallopolis is having a drink or two to celebrate the destruction of the Lantern! Sales have gone through the roof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The young lady who works here fled the city in fear, but now she has returned. The atmosphere is far livelier when she is present, I must say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband left the city in search of a means to deal with the Lantern, but at last he has returned!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was so very worried about him... But I must forget that now. I must take pride in the manner in which he has served his kingdom!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And you are well, yes? You are not hurt? Oh, I have been so worried about you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband's mission is complete, and he has come home at last! His appetite upon his return was most extraordinary\emdash even by his standards!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ahh, but it is truly wonderful to have him back at my table, eating everything I have made with such wild enthusiasm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His mission in the desert appears to have changed my husband. Before, he was rather cold toward me, but now, he displays moments of great kindness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My family and I fled the city like so many others, and upon our return, we found a most disagreeable man in our house.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He appeared to have taken up residence here. Naturally, I chased him away at once, but it was still a most disturbing experience.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Many of us fled to the western checkpoint, but now that the threat of the Lantern looms no longer, we have returned home to the city.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: By the sands, it is good to be home! We saw so many monsters on our journey, I truly did fear the worst at times...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I heard you were on a quest to take down the Lord of Shadows\emdash he's the one who destroyed Yggdrasil, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well that's just wonderful! Most people in Gallopolis have got smiles back on their faces now, but there's still a whole lot of glumness out there in the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you manage to get rid of him, maybe all of Erdrea will be able to start beaming again! Good luck to you! We're behind you all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Our special offer's been extended to celebrate the destruction of Erdwin's Lantern! Entry to the circus is still free for all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That's right\emdash it won't cost you a penny! And that's the same whether you come in the daytime or at night! You won't want to miss this once in a lifetime opportunity!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Amazing! How wonderful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: One of the circus performers took great care of me after I fled to the western checkpoint.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I knew somehow that I could trust him... And then I realised that what I felt was...something more... \f1\u9829?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to the Aloe Beera, sir! Would you care for a drink to celebrate the destruction of the Lantern? Everyone else is having one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That's right! That's what I want to see! Nice smiles from all of you! They'll keep the evil away\emdash and that's a promise!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm back here performing now, but you should have seen how quickly I scarpered when that star started falling out of the sky.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I thought I'd catch pelters for abandoning the circus, but the ringmaster welcomed me back with open arms! (sniff) It was... He's so kind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote The Knight's Pledge\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote A knight's word is his bond, his kingdom his master.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote He serves the weak untiringly, challenges the strong unflinchingly and never retreats in the face of adversity.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Erdwin's Lantern has been destroyed! The kingdom is no longer in danger! All hail our saviour, who delivered us from a terrifying fate!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to the Sultan's Palace! You look rather tired. Your journey here was a long and arduous one, I suspect?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Still, at least now you need not concern yourself with the threat of impending death from above. Go ahead and enjoy the celebratory mood that has taken over Gallopolis!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Erdwin's Lantern has now been dealt with, in no small part due to your intervention, I understand. It seems some grave matter or other is resolved every time you visit us here in Gallopolis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Be sure to return here the next time our kingdom is in trouble, please! Ho ho!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell Can you imagine the strength this saviour must possess to be able to destroy such an enormous star with a single blow? I for one have never before witnessed such a feat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell\par
[pc], it has just occurred to me\emdash surely the saviour would be the ideal ally in your quest to defeat the Lord of Shadows!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell With a hero like that by your side, even that wicked fiend would not stand a chance! I really do not know why you did not think of this yourself, old friend. Thank the sands I am here to help you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell My fellow Gallopolitans, pray listen! Erdwin's Lantern was destroyed by a great saviour! He appeared as though from thin air, and sliced the enormous star clean in two!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell We owe him our very existence! We must let him know that we are grateful! Come! Let us thank him together!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sultan of Gallopolis\cell Calasmos... No, it is not a word that means anything to me. But I shall ask my scholars to investigate. I suspect it must have some deep significance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband told me that you are [pc], the Prince of Dundrasil, and that you are on a quest to defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That is truly admirable\emdash and truly heroic. You are a credit to your mother. Lady Eleanor would be proud. I can still remember her smile as she held you in her arms...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You have grown a great deal since then, of course, but you must remember: no matter how difficult things become, do not waver from your course. All Erdrea is with you, I am certain of that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Faris has informed me of your quest to defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Perhaps you are not aware of it, but my boy is very fond of you. I hope your friendship will be a long one. You would both benefit from such an association, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Calasmos is not a word with which I am familiar\emdash and I take pride in the depth and breadth of my knowledge.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Is it a word from ancient times, perhaps? Or some form of incantation? Even without knowing its meaning, it is possible to detect a certain...significance in its sound.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This man barged into the castle uninvited, though I doubt he will remain here long now that the star is no more. He seems absolutely delighted at having been able to witness its destruction...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was a strange reaction, I thought. Most people felt perhaps a certain thrill of excitement, but most felt only fear. But there are many different types of people in the world, I suppose...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Did ya see it? Did ya see that massive star smash into little bits? It was bleedin' amazin'!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: An' I 'ad the best seats in Gallopolis an' all\emdash right on the Sultan's balcony! I ain't got no regrets about bargin' in uninvited! That was a once in a lifetime experience!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell Well, old friend? Has the Forging Hammer proved useful to you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10320 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Prince Faris\cell It is said that the power of the Spirit of the Land resides within it, and that it can beat even the hardest of metals into shape. It sounds rather ideal for an intrepid adventurer such as yourself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
