\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And yet, the cure for Gold Fever escapes them. It seems they were not quite so clever as we thought. This is a sad discovery...and a frightening one.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was always my dream to build up my business and amass a great fortune, but now, whenever I see a gold coin, it reminds me of the Fever, and I start to quiver with fear.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But so long as I still have customers who want to buy my wares, I will persevere. Perhaps I have something in stock that might interest you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Fever forced me to close my stall, but this kind lady has allowed me to set up shop in here. Sniflheim might be cold and frosty, but its people are the exact opposite!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I used to run a stall out in the street selling the finest herbs and spices from all over Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But then those golden glaciers suddenly appeared and cut the kingdom off from the outside world. Business has completely dried up...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Mamma says I'm not allowed to play outside until the Fever goes away. But I'm so bored!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I want to have a snowball fight! I'm really good at throwing snowballs\emdash all the boys wish they could throw like me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Nooo... I don't want to turn to gold...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I wish I could make the children a nice, steaming pot of fiskesuppe, but ever since Gold Fever struck, we haven't been able to get the ingredients.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We are all doing our very best to keep their little bellies full, but unless somebody finds a cure, they will start to go hungry soon enough...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Master Snorri and I have scoured the ancient tomes for any mention of Gold Fever, but alas, we have come up empty-handed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There is no reference to anything like it in the entire written record. It must be a completely novel illness...or perhaps it is not an illness at all?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have lived in Sniflheim my entire life, and I have never known such dark days as these. Is this all the result of Yggdrasil falling from the sky?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
