\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They used to come here all the time\emdash some to trade, others to drink the mead-hall dry\emdash but it has been some time since last they showed their faces. I hope they are okay...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
