\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And it is not as if she is some kind of flighty flibbertigibbet\emdash she is an old lady who has never missed a day's work in her life. I do hope nothing has happened to her...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
