\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar [pc] hears the screams of the townspeople coming from the other side of the doors. They must have been locked to keep the intruders out\emdash but to no avail...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
