\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thank you, friend. You have saved our kingdom not only from the Fever, but from the Lord of Shadows' servants too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
