\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But after living through so much turmoil and tragedy here, I have become very attached to this kingdom. Now I'm wondering whether to move here permanently...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
