\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Mamma said it was because of you that we are allowed to play outside again. Thank you, mister!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
