*: One of our soldiers has just returned from a scouting expedition to the Sn\'e6rfelt. I bumped into him outside the main gate and he told me the good news.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
