\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I could not risk leaving the city when the Fever was spreading, but now that it is gone, I thought I would bring her out here again as a special treat.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I always thought it was my duty as a groom to raise these horses to be big and strong so that they could one day compete in the Gallopolitan races.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
