\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well done, friends! You rid us of the menace of Gold Fever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
