\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Who does she remind me of? Ah, yes\emdash she looks just like the portrait of the holy sage Serenica in my old school book. Though it is not so much the hair as the demeanour...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Good morning, [pc]. Father Benedictus passed through here this morning on his way to the top of the mountain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He said that you were to join him there, and that I should allow you to pass. I know not what he wishes to tell you, but please, go to him with my blessing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Good day, Luminary. Come, let us offer a prayer that Veronica and the World Tree might find peace...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Father Benedictus came here at dawn, but you were still sleeping. He said that he had some important news to share with you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When I told him you were not yet awake, he departed for the top of the mountain, murmuring under his breath all the while. I wonder what this news could be...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I heard a harp playing in the night. I believe it was a song composed by the holy sage Serenica.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I cannot claim to be a scholar of music, but it moved me to my very core. Never before have I heard such a melancholy melody.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The lady who lost her child is slowly starting to speak again. It is most gratifying to see her recovering some of her old spirit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: They say that it takes half the time spent with a loved one to come to terms with their passing. But do not worry, Luminary\emdash eventually, time heals all wounds...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that the World Tree has fallen, we have naught to turn to for spiritual succour. There is no home in Arboria that has not been touched by grief.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But so long as we have our lives, we must endure. The hopes and dreams of the dearly departed rest upon our shoulders now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ever since the twins were born, they were lauded as the reincarnation of the holy sage Serenica.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that Veronica is gone, it falls to Serena alone to fulfil the destiny that the World Tree had in store for them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote In loving memory of Veronica, daughter of Fidelus and Alma, sister of Serena, scion of Serenica and saviour of the Luminary.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Alma\cell Serena is not a child any more. If it is her heartfelt wish to join you on your travels, I will not stand in her way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Alma\cell But I beg you, Luminary\emdash do not take any unnecessary risks. Promise me that you will all come back to us safe and sound.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ao-ao-aooo...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My boy has been having fewer nightmares of late. It seems the clouds that filled his heart are finally beginning to clear.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But though he no longer tosses and turns, he still murmurs in his sleep. If only the years had not dulled my hearing, I might know what he dreams of now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Zzz... Can I call you...grandmother? (snore)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We chose to erect our memorial to Veronica in the grove north of the village, under the very tree where Serena found her staff. Go there and offer up a prayer, I prithee.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ahh, it seems like only yesterday that those woods resounded with their happy laughter... (sigh) Where do the years go...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The World Tree has fallen, and Serenica's pure-white robes are blackened with smoke and ash. No matter how many tears we shed, they will not wash the stains away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And even if they could, we have no cause to cry\emdash so long as you are here, Luminary, we know that all will be well again in time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Good day, Luminary. Veronica's memorial has been erected in the verdant sanctum at the end of this path. If you should wish to offer a prayer for her, please proceed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Veronica was a sharp-tongued soul\emdash no doubt she would have answered my own prayers with a stinging riposte\emdash but I am sure she would be overjoyed to hear from you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The birds, the insects...even the trees are crying. When all is still, I hear their tearful voices.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Dear Veronica sacrificed herself to save us all. I do not doubt that they weep for her...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome back to Arboria, Luminary\emdash the home of the Keepers... Though the peace we strove to protect has long since slipped through our fingers...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Still, we can but persevere. By our efforts, the legend of the Luminary may yet be kept alive, and with it, the memory of dear Veronica...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Urrrgh... I am so hungry that I can barely move... My stomach feels as though it has completely shrivelled up...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...But my suffering pales in comparison to the trials Veronica underwent. I must learn from her example, gird up my loins and seek out some food!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hmm... So this is the famous antidotal herb tea all Arboria is talking about? It is certainly more palatable than the stale sweepings we were drinking before. But it is very bitter...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So many leaves fell from Yggdrasil's branches on that dark day... And those of us who remain are buffeted by the winds of sadness and despair...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But we shall stand strong. After all, imagine how Veronica will chide us in the next life if we do not!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Long have I guarded the path to Luminary's Landing, preventing trespassers from setting foot on that sacred ground. But I shall stand in your way no longer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that you have the power to summon Cetacea, there is nowhere in this world that is beyond your reach. May She carry you wherever your destiny may lead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was Veronica's last wish that you complete your journey, Luminary. I pray that you have the best of luck in the battles to come. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, you do our humble hostelry the greatest honour by gracing us with your presence once more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
