\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, you will never believe this, but if you dry antidotal herbs and steep them in boiling water, it makes the most delicious tea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
