\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Obsidian was in such a good mood, I knew straight away that you and Sir Hendrik must have come home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You should go and say hello before you head off again. Horses remember these things, you know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: To think, one day you're a little boy, running round playing tricks on people, and the next, you're the saviour of the whole world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I just know old Chalky is looking down from heaven with a big smile on his face!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: There's no load I wouldn't carry for the fair Princess Jade!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm not going to lie to you, I fell head over heels in love with Princess Jade the second I saw those sultry eyes of hers. I reckon I'm in with a chance, you know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Things are going to be just fine once we all get back to Heliodor. With Princess Jade and Sir Hendrik on our side, we've got nothing to worry about!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that the world is at peace once more, Derk has thrown himself heart and soul into rekindling the fires of commerce. One cannot help but feel proud.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: His noble goal is to return to Heliodor, to open an even grander boutique and to keep one in the manner to which one has become accustomed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I guess once Cobblestone has been restored to its former glory, we'll be moving on. Seems a shame\emdash I've grown pretty attached to the place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Zzz... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Heading to the Tor, are you? It's strange that the people of Cobblestone are so attached to the place\endash there's really nothing there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Seeing Sir Hendrik and Princess Jade together reminds me of the old days.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was always quite a sight\emdash the big, tough knight comforting the little girl when the King had scolded her... Ahh, they were like brother and sister...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The big grin on 'Er Ladyship's face makes me day every time I see it, it really does! She's family now, an' nuffink beats yer nearest an' dearest bein' 'appy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Derk\cell Wotcher! Fancy you droppin' by, eh? This calls for a celebration! May I suggest a nice bit o' shoppin'? Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Dunstan\cell You know it makes my Gemma miserable you being away, don't you? It fair breaks my heart to see it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Dunstan\cell I know you're not going away for long this time, but bring her back a present or something, will you? It'll mean the world to her, poor dear.\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\b\fs24\par
2.19 - Angri-La (Post-Credits)\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Greetings, Luminary. You have slain the Lord of Shadows, have you not? The good news has already reached us, even in this far-flung corner of the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You took a great risk in challenging him, and all so that we could once again live in peace. For that, we cannot thank you enough.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote\emdash  Message from the High Lama \emdash\par
\par
Disciples of Angri-La, though the Luminary and his allies have triumphed over Mordegon, we must not neglect our training.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Who can say what path the universe has in store for us? Let us submit ourselves to the rigours of the Wheel of Harma, that we might grow in strength and skill. We must be ready for any eventuality.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When the Lord of Shadows sent the World Tree crashing to the ground, Grand Master Pang gave her life to protect the temple and everyone within it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And now Mordegon is no more. The wheel of fate has come full circle, and all is thanks to you. We are in your debt, Luminary.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to Angri-La. Disciples flock here from all over Erdrea, seeking to perfect their physical and spiritual selves. But of course, you know that already, Luminary.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No doubt your battle with the Lord of Shadows has left you drained. Please, stay with us awhile. Every man, woman and child of Angri-La stands ready to welcome you with open arms.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to Angri-La, Luminary. We have just heard the news\emdash that you and your companions have defeated the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone at the temple is eager to offer the saviours of our world their congratulations. Pray, stay and speak with us awhile.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now that you have slain the Lord of Shadows and brought the World Tree back to life, this scarred land will surely begin to return to the way it once was.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And it is all thanks to you! There are no words to express our gratitude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The view from the balcony is breathtaking, is it not? Even in this cold and inhospitable place, the flame of life burns brightly. We must ensure that its light is never extinguished.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Have you heard? Lord Robert and his friends defeated the Lord of Shadows! He might seem to be a strange and fat old man, but he really is the Red-Cheeked Seeker after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The High Lama has accepted me as a disciple. I won't start training properly until I'm older, but for now, I've decided to walk up and down these stairs to build up my stamina.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm going to train as hard as I can so that one day, I can be just as impervious to pain as the Red-Cheeked Seeker!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Lord Robert aided you in defeating the Lord of Shadows, did he not?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He risked his life to challenge a monster more powerful than any this world has ever seen, and emerged victorious. No wonder he was the Grand Master's favourite pupil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Many people have lost their lives at the Lord of Shadows' hands. It falls to those of us who remain to return this world to the way it once was.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Mother Yggdrasil has nourished us with Her bounty\emdash we have a sacred duty to heal the wounds of this land of Hers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Lord of Shadows is gone, but his servants still remain. The monsters who were corrupted by his evil influence will not simply give up and walk away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That is why you must complete your training with all haste. The High Lama needs disciples to stand beside him and continue the fight!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well done, Luminary, well done! You have laid the Lord of Shadows low, just as the Grand Master would have wanted!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah, Luminary! I always believed that you would triumph in the fight against the Lord of Shadows\emdash after all, you trained with the great Grand Master Pang herself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Alright, I'll stay. This temple has been good to me. I'll do all I can to help get it back on its feet again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I was planning to go back to my hometown, but the disciples asked me to stay and help protect the temple, so I'll be here for a while longer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh2033\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Though peace has returned to Erdrea, Angri-La is still but a shadow of its former self. \par
\par
*: The Grand Master is gone, the Heliodorian siege has drained our resources and we are hounded on all sides by the servants of the Lord of Shadows. \par
\par
*: Though I know you are eager to return home, will you stay awhile and aid us in protecting the temple?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Lord of Shadows is no more, and the wheel of fate has come full circle. But we did not escape unscathed\emdash those who lost their lives when the World Tree fell will not return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If only Mordegon could have been prevented from stealing Yggdrasil's power... I know that it is futile to dwell on that which cannot be changed, but still, I cannot stop myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You and your friends are the saviours of this world. Everyone in Erdrea owes you a deep debt of gratitude.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: To think that the one we slandered as the Darkspawn would slay the Lord of Shadows and restore peace to the world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I thank you, friend, from the bottom of my heart. You are no devil child\emdash you are a hero beyond compare.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Wow, you must be a lot tougher than my brother to be able to beat the Lord of Shadows. Will you teach him how to be strong like you?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah, brother... Don't give up... You can do it... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that Rab has been building up quite the collection of, erm...how can I put this...provocative periodicals. It seems there's life in the old dog yet!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I say it was the vigour he received from these stimulating reading materials that gave him the edge in the fight against the Lord of Shadows! The Ogler's Digest has saved us all! Heh heh heh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was the bonds of trust and friendship that Erdwin shared with Morcant and the other heroes of old that gave him the strength to lay the Dark One low.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And it is the same with you, Luminary. The Lord of Shadows might still reign even now if you had not been blessed with the support of your friends. Never forget the debt of gratitude you owe them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Lord of Shadows was powerful enough to send the World Tree crashing to the ground...and you were powerful enough to defeat him, Luminary. Grand Master Pang would have been proud.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My friend was chosen to be High Lama. Amazing, isn't it? He's only the same age as me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He's got a lot of hard work in front of him, but I'm sure he'll be able to handle it. After all, I'll be there to help him every step of the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Congratulations on your victory over the Lord of Shadows, Luminary. If Grand Master Pang could see you now, she would be proud indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Will you be joining us in our training today, [pc]?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: After the Dark One's defeat, the King of Dundrasil made a pact with Grand Master Ai Yi to train the princes of his kingdom in the ancient arts of Angri-La. \par
\par
*: That way, they would always be ready to defend their people should crisis ever strike again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You trained with Grand Master Pang and learned her secrets, then used that knowledge to lay the Lord of Shadows low\emdash your forefathers were wise indeed to begin this tradition.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Tell me, Luminary\emdash did you use the ancient technique the Grand Master taught you in your fight against the Lord of Shadows?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Thanks to you, the World Tree has been reborn, the cycle of souls has begun anew and those who lost their lives may live again among Her all-embracing boughs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You have safeguarded the future of Erdrea, and for that, you have our eternal thanks.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
