\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aren't these flowers pretty? Monsieur M\f4\'e9daill\'e9 likes the lilies of the valley best of all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He says the way their little white petals catch the eye reminds him of mini medals. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whatever's in that tub that Jarmima carries around with her, it's absolutely amazing! As soon as she sprinkles it on a wilting flower, it springs right back to life!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to her mystery mixture, the lilies of the valley are even more full of life than they were before. Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 will be ever so pleased! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No matter what age they enrol at, young ladies must undergo seven years of rigorous training before they are allowed to graduate from the Acad\'e9mie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is my fifth year. When I first arrived, I was so homesick, I cried for my parents every night. Now, I can't imagine living anywhere else! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Thanks for telling me about this place! If I'd spent any longer on my own in the Eerie Eyrie, I would have gone potty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell I've made a lot of friends already, and the teachers are all really nice\f3\emdash\f4 when they're not shouting at me for breaking the chairs, that is. I feel like I've hit the jackpot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Here, this is for you\f3\emdash\f4 you've more than urned it! Jeeble jarble joo! \par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell NOT USED\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Jeeble jarble joo! It wasn't just pot luck that you found me\f3\emdash\f4 it was all thanks to my mummy's happy-making spell!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell It's really powerful magic\f3\emdash\f4 whenever you're feeling sad, just say \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote , and you'll soon be happier than a tot in the tub!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Jeeble jarble joo! It wasn't just pot luck that you found me\f3\emdash\f4 it was all thanks to my mummy's happy-making spell!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell It's really powerful magic\f3\emdash\f4 whenever you're feeling sad, just say \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote , and you'll soon be happier than a tot in the tub!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day, sir. We are the proud members of Les M\'e9damoiselles Magnifiques\f3\emdash\f4 an exclusive club for only the most dedicated disciples of grace and elegance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though the world is at peace once more, that is no excuse to be negligent in one's training!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So come along, ladies\f3\emdash\f4 practice makes perfect! And a-one, and a-two, and a-one, two, three\f3\emdash\f4 go! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good evening, sir. This table is reserved exclusively for the honourable members of Les M\'e9damoiselles Magnifiques.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Supper is a daily test of a lady's true elegance. When lifting the bread, one must always remember to keep one's little finger perfectly perpendicular! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A true M\'e9damoiselle Magnifique has a stout heart, an iron will and a never-say-die attitude, just like the Luminary!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's why I've decided to knuckle down and follow the big girls' instructions to the letter. One day I'll be the elegantest lady Erdrea's ever seen! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A true lady does not turn up her nose at any dish! Her sniffer must remain unwaveringly level at all times!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just have to trick myself into thinking the peppers are crisp, sweet apples and the carrots are soft, juicy strawberries, and I'll be able to lick my platter clean! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm Chantelle the chanteussse, and ever sssince Yggdrasssil came back to life, I've been back to my old, sssunny ssself again! I jussst can't ssstop sssinging!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Would you like me to sssing a sssong for you? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Yaaay! Thanksss! Okay then, if you're ready\f3\emdash\f4 Chantelle the chanteussse shall sssing the ssschool sssong, essspecially for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell 'Neath the branches of the birches \f1\u9834?\f4\par
Daffodils sssway and ssswiiing \f1\u9834?\f4\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Here among the graceful gardens \f1\u9834?\f4\par
Budding young ladies sssiiing! \f1\u9834?\f4\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell We'll ssstride acrosss the wide, wide world \f1\u9834?\f4\par
And hunt for mini medals low and hiiigh \f1\u9834?\f4\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell But our heartsss live forever in \f1\u9834?\f4\par
L'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles! \f1\u9834?\f4\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Oh no, what a shame! But don't worry\f3\emdash\f4 I'll keep practisssing, ssso when you do finally want to hear me sssing, I'll be even better!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This little river is absolutely teeming with......nothing. To tell the truth, I've run out of bait......so now I'm just practising. It helps build up my......patience.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's fun and all, but there's one big problem......something's really starting to stink. I hope nobody's been using this river for......something other than fishing...... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This little river is absolutely teeming with......nothing. To tell the truth, I've run out of bait......so now I'm just practising. It helps build up my......patience.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It used to pong a bit around here, but now that Malodorine's joined in......it doesn't any more. She smells......lovely. It's like being out in the flower garden...... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a wonderful day! Yggdrasil's high in the sky and everything's right with the world! All that remains is to get rid of this horrid dust! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yggdrasil is back where She belongs and the world is at peace again, but this little girl is still making a nuisance of herself! Honestly, I do wish the younger ones wouldn't get so overexcited...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Lord of Shadows 'as fallen, but ze world is still in a bad way. Many people 'ave lost zeir lives, yet some can still be saved. ...And zat is where you come in!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I 'ave a petit requ\'eate for you\f3\emdash\f4 if, on your travels, you should meet wiz any young girls 'oo 'ave been left alone\f3\emdash\f4 sans parents\f3\emdash\f4 I want you to tell zem about zis place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie is a safe 'aven in zis world dangereux, and we 'ave warm beds and 'ot food to spare. Our doors are always open to any jeune fille 'oo needs our 'elp in zese troubled times.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze entire facult\'e9 stands ready to welcome zem into our 'umble \'e9tablissement, and aid zem in any way we can!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bonjour, monsieur! Les jeunes filles zat you sent to us are already making zemselves at 'ome. It is so nice to see ze young ladies safe and well.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though ze scars on zeir 'earts may never fully 'eal, zose girls are brave beyond zeir years. Already, zey are putting ze past behind zem and focusing on ze future.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In time, zey will recover, and\f3\emdash\f4 wiz ze 'elp of all of us 'ere at l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles\f3\emdash\f4 zey will flourish!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I 'ave a petit requ\'eate for you\f3\emdash\f4 if, on your travels, you should meet wiz any young girls 'oo 'ave been left alone\f3\emdash\f4 sans parents\f3\emdash\f4 I want you to tell zem about zis place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie is a safe 'aven in zis world dangereux, and we 'ave warm beds and 'ot food to spare. Our doors are always open to any jeune fille 'oo needs our 'elp in zese troubled times.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\f1\u9670?\f5\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f6\'a1\'be\f5\'83\'5a\'81\'5b\'83\'56\'83\'46\'83\'8b\'82\'c6\'83\'69\'83\'5e\'81\'5b\'83\'56\'83\'83\'82\'f0\'93\'fc\'8a\'77\'82\'b3\'82\'b9\'82\'bd\'8c\'e3\f6\'a1\'bf\f5\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f4\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. I'm Candida, the chef de classe. It's my role to look after the other girls and keep them in line, but they really don't make it easy for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Recently, it's Malodorine Delamorgue who's been giving me the biggest headache. She usually smells lovely, but ever since the Fall, she's really started to pong.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell None of the other girls really mind\f3\emdash\f4 she is a walking corpse, after all\f3\emdash\f4 but Malodorine's so upset about it, she's started bunking off lessons to avoid bothering anyone. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. I'm Candida, the chef de classe. It's my role to look after the other girls and keep them in line, but they really don't make it easy for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell At least I don't have to worry about Malodorine any more. I'm not sure what happened, but she seems to be back to her old sweet-smelling self\f3\emdash\f4 thank goodness.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Some kindly soul must have...helped her with her little situation. After all the headaches she gave me, I can't thank them enough! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\par
\lquote She opens wide her shining eyes and searches for her shiny prize!\par
The wide-eyed wanderer espies a medal of a tiny size!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\lquote Take it, dear girl, come, realise the wonder that before you lies!\par
And on your way home, visualise your classmates' laudatory cries!\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Whenever I read Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's poetry to a restless student, it sends them straight to sleep. He's a real lifesaver! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell This poor girl must have seen some terrible things. She always seems so cheery in class, but as soon as she's alone, she starts sobbing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell It must be a real struggle for her to hold back the tears, but she stays strong to avoid upsetting the other girls... Such a thoughtful child... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I finally got a reply from my little brothers back home. They said there were great golden glaciers blocking the routes in and out of Sniflheim, so they had only just got my letter.\par
*: Honestly, they could have just said they didn't have the time to write to me. They didn't have to make up a silly excuse like that.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, now that they are back in touch, I must make some more handkerchiefs to send them. I can't sleep until I've embroidered at least twenty more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, the money they get for selling them pays for their food and clothes. If it wasn't for me, they'd starve, or freeze...or both.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello! It's lovely to see you again. Thank you so much for telling me about this place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm so happy to be living here with all the other girls. I don't feel like crying any more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is for you... For saving me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell NOT USED\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be a teacher just like Madame Waloppe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And whenever my students are feeling sad, I'll give them a great big hug to cheer them up, just like the one she gave me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be a teacher just like Madame Waloppe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And whenever my students are feeling sad, I'll give them a great big hug to cheer them up, just like the one she gave me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Make sure you watch your manners around Madame Labouche\f3\emdash\f4 she's the deportment mistress, which means she's very fussy about appearance and behaviour.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's bad enough with us girls, so I can't even imagine how strict she'd be with a boy. You're not even supposed to be here! I'd be very, very careful around her if I were you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Cooking for zese girls is a true test of endurance! You think zey are delicate little flowers, nibbling away on raindrops and sunbeams? Peh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Non, zey are ravenous monsters wiz bottomless pits where zeir stomachs should be! No matter 'ow much I pile on zeir plates, zey lick zem clean and beg for more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, \lquote you are what you eat\rquote , as zey say. Zese debutantes-to-be are lucky I use only ze finest ingredients! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You want to know what is on ze menu tonight, hein? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a tour de culinary force, even if I say so myself! Ze centrepiece will be ze bouillabaisse Valoreux\f3\emdash\f4 a fish dish filled with ze tastiest fruits de mer ze Costa Valor 'as to offer!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dip in a freshly baked bun made wiz finest Zwaardsrustian wheat, and it soaks up ze sauce like an \'e9ponge! You will want to lick your plate clean, but do not forget your manners, hein?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: For dessert, we 'ave g\'e2teau aux fraises from ze finest p\'e2tisserie in Gondolia, and tropical fruits all ze way from ze seaside paradise of Lonalulu!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Each and every item on ze menu is packed full of vitamins, minerals...et l'amour! Eat your fill, and you too may grow to be a lovely lady, just like my girls! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh...zen you 'ave come to 'elp me, per'aps? Merci, ch\'e9ri\f3\emdash\f4 thank you for ze kind offer, but I 'ave done all ze 'ard work already! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Jarmima is a culinary g\'e9nie! A petit pinch of whatever she keeps in zat pot makes any meal I make taste fantastique!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If only she would reveal to me 'er secret recipe! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello! I'm Madeleine. I'm the head dinner monitor! Do you want to know what's on the menu tonight? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell Tee hee! Then I'll tell you! Madame Croque will be serving Valorian bouillabaisse\f3\emdash\f4 that's a kind of fish stew\f3\emdash\f4 filled with the finest seafood the Costa Valor has to offer!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell If you dip in a freshly baked bun made with finest Zwaardsrustian wheat, it soaks up the sauce like a sponge! You'll want to lick your plate clean, but don't forget your manners!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
