\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey, are you as worried about graduating as I am? The thought of heading out into the great unknown all alone makes me go weak at the knees... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
