\cellx1362\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: R-Really? Oh, thank you, thank you! You don't know how much this means to me\f3\emdash\f4 how much...you mean to me... Promise me that we'll never be apart? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
